{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00858","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南 · 刘驾","name":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城南征战多，城北无饥鵶。\n白骨马蹄下，谁言皆有家。\n城前水声苦，倏忽流万古。\n莫争城外地，城里有闲土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}